  PROMPT["00 FOUNDER TYPES AN ORDINARY PROMPT<br/>or /ubermind-lean TASK in Claude Code"] --> LEAD["UBERMIND OMEGA 12 • NATIVE PRO USAGE GOVERNOR<br/>one lead Claude session, full-quality contract, $0 extra API"]
