  EXACT -- "YES, tenant/version/freshness/permission verified" --> NATIVE["L0 ZERO-FRESH-INFERENCE SUBSTRATE<br/>Local grep/AST, tests, diff, database read,<br/>verified cache, deterministic procedures"]
